abstract: >-
  The companion software package for the closing report on the Rupert
  problem for Johnson solid J73. It carries the independent checker, local
  certificates, tube regions and frozen data from the interim release, with
  the closing report and its numerical source ledger. The global exclusion
  proof and exhaustive verification of the cover remain unfinished.
keywords:
  - Rupert problem
  - Johnson solid J73
  - parabigyrate rhombicosidodecahedron
  - exact arithmetic
  - interval arithmetic
  - computer-assisted proof
repository-code: "https://github.com/ysmin1575/j73-rupert"
url: "https://github.com/ysmin1575/j73-rupert"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
# Concept DOI: resolves to the latest software version.
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23724947"
